  "description": {
   "value": "<p><em>Auspicious Beast Summon — Innate Technique (18th level)</em></p><p><em>Domain Expansion (rules): full-turn action, 20 CE unless stated, 175-ft radius, 1 minute. When the domain ends you suffer <strong>Technique Burnout</strong> (applied automatically by the module).</em></p><p>Finally, at 18th level, you have honed your Cursed Technique to an extreme. While in this domain, all of your Auspicious Beasts are constantly active without side effects. Attacks made by Kaichi and Ryu always hit. Kirin refreshes at initiative 20 as if you spent Cursed Energy up to your CE modifier.</p>",
